### 1. Avvio Task di Riparazione (Self-Refinement Loop)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/task-test-01/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repoPath": "./",
  "issueSpec": "Sanitize query input to prevent SQL injection in lookup_user",
  "targetFiles": ["src/types/domain.ts"],
  "testFiles": ["tests/DiffScoper.test.ts"],
  "isBaseline": false
}

### 2. Ascolto SSE Stream
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/task-test-01/stream
Accept: text/event-stream
